WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
That's right

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,720
But this pound of salt comes from the sun

3
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:05,880
There is also half a pound of salt that has been steamed and left relatively clean.

4
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,320
What kind do you need, senior?

5
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,760
This guy seems to have some skills.

6
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,760
The salt exposed in the sun has many impurities

7
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:14,280
And eating too much can be harmful

8
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,480
But the steamed ones are much better.

9
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,560
Let’s change to something better and eat healthily

10
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,160
Then I'll replace it with the steamed one.

11
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,200
I want all the half a pound

12
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:23,480
Also, find me some shells, preferably bigger ones.

13
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:24,640
Can be used to make pots

14
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:25,920
Give me another fifty liters of sea water

15
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:28,440
What would you give in exchange for asking for so much?

16
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:30,940
Is a whole cow head enough?

17
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:33,640
Pick up some shells to eat every day

18
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:36,090
I can eat it

19
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:38,050
Brother, feel free to change it

20
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,740
This guy is pretty trustworthy.

21
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,420
Hi, what integrity?

22
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:45,780
It’s just that both of them still have value that can be used.

23
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:47,780
Hurry, get some salt and wrap it around me.
